Z||000011||FIERO JOHN-WI||09-12-2001||08:06 AM||||Well 10 days left, I thank all of you for your support, shes a wonderful woman and she loves me!  I just have one question for fiero owners that are married:  Was your other half having weird dreams before you were to get married?  Mine is, she told me this morning that she had a dream, that she couldn't  find her wedding shoes anywhere so her mom told her just to where her leopard pumps, because her dress is long enough and knowbody will see them, then she said later that night when it was time to take off the GARTER (CAN'T WAIT) she sat down on the grooms lap lifted up her dress to cross her legs, and everbody seen the shoes and started laughing and the DJ made fun of her then she woke up. WHATS KIND OF DREAM IS THAT I SAID. Then I said: If you have the matching underwear on  what are you worried about, we both started laughing. But anyway is this normal because I'm not having any dreams!   ||||reg||1
